  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Blood Golem"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "A haunting manifestation of crimson and bone rises from the earth's depths in response to the caster's call. Though its body lacks the resilience typical of more robust constructs, it possesses a sinister "
        },
        {
          "text": "vitality that replenishes with each strike it lands upon ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "living ",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "foes.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nEach successful blow siphons living mass from its targets, restoring its own flesh while "
        },
        {
          "text": "simultaneously channelling a small portion of that life force back to the caster",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", creating an unholy bond of shared sustenance.\n\nThis bond is so difficult to keep hold of that only one golem per caster can be maintained.\n\nThese golems can only be called forth by the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demons of the Nether.",
          "color": "dark_red"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "spell_part",
      "location": "mna:components/blood_golem"
    }
  ]
}